but was told that they were still waiting for an officer to arrive. Summers then left the office. Nix and Laura were left alone once more. Officer Scott resumed his instructions. He told Nix to have Laura sit on his lap and give him a kiss so that he could smell anything that might be on her breath. Laura went numb and felt as though her soul left her body. Just before 7.30pm, Officer Scott demanded that Laura remove Nix's pants
